      "widgets_values": [
        "A full body hand drawn 2D cartoon man quietly idles in place. He slowly exhales, his shoulders relax, and he makes one small curious head tilt and glances sideways, then settles back into his starting pose. His raised hand keeps resting against his hair, his other hand holds his mug steady. Very small natural movement. Preserve the character identity, moustache, clothing, thick black ink outlines and muted colors of the reference. Fixed camera, full body stays in frame, plain neutral grey background."
      ],
